    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract inference engine interface for dependency injection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this interface to provide a real or test LLM backend to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1judge_1_1_l_l_m_judge_integration" kindref="compound">LLMJudgeIntegration</ref> via the engine-injection constructor.</para>
<para>Example (test double returning random scores): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">struct<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">RandomEngine<sp/>:<sp/>ILLMInferenceEngine<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>generate(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::string&amp;)</highlight><highlight class="keyword"><sp/>override<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>R</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;({&quot;score&quot;:)&quot;<sp/>+<sp/>std::to_string(dist_(rng_))<sp/>+<sp/>R</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;(,&quot;confidence&quot;:0.8})&quot;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="stringliteral"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">private</highlight><highlight class="normal">:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::mt19937<sp/>rng_{std::random_device{}()};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::uniform_real_distribution&lt;double&gt;<sp/>dist_{1.0,<sp/>5.0};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
